#op: cli
#args: data translate -l lineage.cue --to 0.0 data.json
An operation that searches the lineage for the data's schema found none that
accepts it: the CLI's translate, or the playground's validate-any, or its
translate without a from version. Validating against one version (data
validate -v) names what that schema rejects.
-- lineage.cue --
name: "ship"
schemas: {
	"0": {
		"0": {
			schema: {
				a: string
			}
		}
	}
}
-- data.json --
{"a": 1}
-- out/json --
{
  "diagnostics": [
    {
      "code": "E0508",
      "severity": "error",
      "headline": "the data is an instance of no schema in the lineage",
      "help": [
        "validate it against one version with -v to see what that schema rejects"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "errors": 1,
    "warnings": 0,
    "notes": 0
  }
}
-- out/text --
error[E0508]: the data is an instance of no schema in the lineage
